              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="347e-ee4a-764f-6be3">The Auric Armour provides Rogal Dorn with 2+ Armour Save and 4+ Invulnable Save. In addition, no attack may wound Rogal Dorn on better than a 4+ regardless of its Strength or special rules.</characteristic>
